# Change review loop

After you **implement** a feature or bugfix, do not stop at the impact check. Run the loop in [`.cursor/skills/change-review-loop/SKILL.md`](../skills/change-review-loop/SKILL.md).

1. Parent stays the coding agent (do not spawn a second implementer).
2. In parallel: `change-reviewer` (edge cases, tests, splits) and `security-reviewer` (auth, XSS, Mongo, Telegram, secrets, CDP).
3. Fix **Must-fix** only; list Should-fix; drop Skip.
4. Re-review at most **one** extra round (max 2 total). Then stop.

Skip the loop for questions, docs-only, user “don’t review”, or commit/push with no new code. If the user also asked to ship, finish this loop **before** commit.
